  "title": {
   "en": "I'm Retiring from the Role of a Wife!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "妻を引退します"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Tsuma o Intai Shimasu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Ayukawa Honami (30), once a child prodigy who took the entertainment world by storm, has now retired from show business and is living a happy married life as a mother of one. At the urging of her husband, who runs a talent agency, she allows her daughter to debut as a child actor. However, during a commercial shoot, her daughter becomes entangled in a troubling incident. When Honami discovers that the accident was caused by her husband's infidelity and a grudge from her own child actor days, she decides to make a comeback as a star actress. What follows is a grand tale of revenge that engulfs the entire entertainment industry."
  },
